coding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/prophotoskills.github.io\/pps-assets\/images\/T01_L02_Das-zweite-oder-dritte-Model-sitzt-wartend-herum_1553x1024_k.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"675\" alt=\"Das zweite oder dritte Model sitzt wartend herum\" class=\"et_pb_post_main_image\" \/><span data-icon=\"\ue050\" class=\"et_overlay et_pb_inline_icon\"><\/span><\/a><h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"https:\/\/prophotoskills.com\/t01_l02_das-zweite-oder-dritte-model-sitzt-wartend-herum\/\">Das zweite oder dritte Model sitzt wartend herum<\/a><\/h2><p class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"entry-categories\"><a href=\"https:\/\/prophotoskills.com\/category\/skill\/\" rel=\"tag\">SKILL<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/prophotoskills.com\/category\/skill\/t01_l02\/\" rel=\"tag\">T01_L02<\/a><\/span><\/p><div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner\"><p>Warum wartende Models am Set ein untersch\u00e4tzter Faktor f\u00fcr Energie, Fokus und die Qualit\u00e4t der gesamten Produktion sind.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/article><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_5 et_pb_row et_pb_row_nested et_flex_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_7 et_pb_column et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et_flex_column_12_24 et_flex_column_12_24_tablet et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_blog_3 et_pb_blog et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_posts et_pb_module\" title=\"Was Fotografen von Spitzensportlern lernen k\u00f6nnen: Disziplin, Training und kontinuierliche Verbesserung als Erfolgsfaktoren.\" alt=\"Professionelle Disziplin in der Fotografie\"><div class=\"et_pb_ajax_pagination_container\"><div class=\"et_pb_blog_posts et_flex_module\"><article class=\"et_pb_post et_pb_post_id_8968 clearfix et_pb_blog_item_3_0 post-8968 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-skill category-t05_e01 tag-skill tag-t05_e01\"><h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"https:\/\/prophotoskills.com\/t05_e01_was-haben-fussballer-und-fotografen-g